// test: Query builders whose DQL does not parse or names unknown fields
// feature: diagnostics
// Ported from PHPStan's Doctrine extension, QueryBuilderDqlRuleTest::testRule.
// project: phpstan_doctrine
// file: rules/Doctrine/ORM/data/query-builder-dql.php
// codes: unknown_class, unknown_entity_field, dql_syntax_error
// PHPantom reports a name on the line its string spells it, where upstream reports the line the call starts on.
